Expect $96.0B (80% interval $92.6-99.4B; back-test MAPE 2.5%). Budget ($95.2B), last year&apos;s growth ($96.2B) and run-rate plus pipeline ($94.0B) all fall inside the band. The pipeline covers only 63% of the gap to budget, so new deals must close for the top half.</run>
